diff --git a/research/integration/undo_compare_commit_v1/ISSUE_DRAFT.md b/research/integration/undo_compare_commit_v1/ISSUE_DRAFT.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d59be29
--- /dev/null
+++ b/research/integration/undo_compare_commit_v1/ISSUE_DRAFT.md
@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+# DRAFT — not posted to GitHub
+
+Proposed title: Successor #4043: compare/Undo across application event-loop reentry
+
+This would retrospectively register already executed allocation
+undo-compare-commit-20260922-01. Local source freeze preceded measurement;
+GitHub preregistration did not occur because this session exposed no write tool.
+No new formal run is needed to publish this evidence.
+
+Changed scientific factor: concurrent/pending native edits after history check,
+and servicing them inside a nominally single application callback. This is not
+another pre-check content-ABA replication, supervisor repair or upload study.
+Preserve #4043/#4054, prior local45, #431/#438, #4006 and all other original results.
+Use attached PLAN.md for complete H/T/D/C/U and REPORT.md for results/limits.
+
+Formal40: four routes x five schedules x two repetitions. Exactly two20-case
+batches; no retry/replacement/source tuning. Same private Tk Text; actual native
+keys from distinct processes; inline candidate is explicitly cooperative and
+application-specific. Status8 wrong effects,20 correct Undo,12 unresolved.
+Independent raw audit40/40;12 corruption designs rejected in each batch.
+No-yield8/10 correct+2 refused; yielded no-recheck4/10 correct+4 wrong+2 refused;
+recheck4/10 correct+6 refused. The client split4/10 correct+4 wrong+2 refused.
+
+Only additive research/integration/undo_compare_commit_v1/. No shared runtime,
+workflow, root docs or predecessor edits. #2789/global ROADMAP remain open.
+Publication failures belong here, not a wrapper-only successor. Merge only
+qualified retained evidence with exact byte readback/current-head checks.
