+# DRAFT — not posted; no PR number
+
+Retain the completed compare/Undo event-loop boundary experiment, including all
+40 first outcomes, excluded construction, exact sources, application/IPC/native
+key logs, final files, actual exits, freeze and independent audits/challenges.
+Use the separate Issue draft only for retrospective registration, not another run.
+
+Science: PASS_COMPARE_UNDO_REENTRANCY_BOUNDARY_SCOPED. This rejects split/check or
+single-call-with-update as sufficient general Undo-scoping assumptions in the
+fixture. All8 wrong outcomes and12 unresolved refusals remain in the denominator.
+No-yield and final-recheck are scoped application contracts, not production
+promotion, model utility, speed, generic cancellation or global-roadmap claims.
+
+All changes MUST be additions under research/integration/undo_compare_commit_v1/.
+No shared runtime/workflow/old result edit. Current connection is read-only;
+this draft is not evidence of a created branch/PR, successful CI or main merge.
+Run read-only verify_bundle.py after download. Review the explicit cooperative
+API and no-reentrancy assumptions before any later app/runtime integration.
